    skos:scopeNote """There is a general obligation for Member States to notify existing national rules but:  Member States may decide not to notify rules and restrictions of a strictly local nature. In such cases, Member States shall mention those rules and restrictions in the registers of infrastructure.
In this eventuality, this parameter allows the IM accordingly to its Member State decision to declare the existence of such rules and to provide them with the parameter 'Documents regarding the rules or restrictions of a strictly local nature available by the IM'"""@en .

